    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af9a73f3259e0f6e212a292</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:10:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这里是读报聊上周日本节目，主持人：Seki，嘉宾：嘉麟前辈</span></p><p><span>本期主要内容：</span></p><p><span>1、日本小学生提问：为什么豆腐要用腐坏的“腐”字？</span></p><p><span>2、2026年日本的自然灾害有哪些</span></p><p><span>3、日本最新研究：养狗的老人医药费低</span><br></p><p><span>4、皇居和江户城有啥关系？</span></p><p><span>5、日本的棋士和女流棋士，有什么不同？</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/31fa-audiofreehighqps/A7/AB/GKwRIaIOz2MIAA7s7wT7wpVQ.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/6681-audiofreehighqps/7C/86/GAqhwcMOz2NAABbI4QT7wr4q.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><br><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/ad63-audiofreehighqps/62/0D/GKwRIJIOz2NMAAb0GQT7wsT3.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/1fa6-audiofreehighqps/B2/A8/GKwRIUEOz2NXAA9Z_gT7wsnp.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/6465-audiofreehighqps/EC/61/GKwRIaIOz2NiAAavagT7wtBg.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/9e05-audiofreehighqps/97/4E/GAqhhs0Oz2NwABEu0wT7wtkt.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/90a7-audiofreehighqps/2A/B5/GAqhxOkOz2N7AAs1UgT7wt_X.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">00:02:04</a>:豆腐的奥秘：为什么豆腐的汉字来自中国的乳腐？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">00:05:22</a>:从中国到日本：豆腐和纳豆在不同国家的演变与命名</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">00:10:47</a>:中日汉字文化对比：豆腐和豆腐的故事引发的思考</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">00:16:11</a>:酷暑日下的日本</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">00:26:57</a>居家避难需要什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">00:32:25</a>:遛狗带来的好处：规律生活、运动量保证和社交交流</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2595">00:43:15</a>:探索东京站附近的文化宝藏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2916">00:48:36</a>:皇居的历史与文化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3242">00:54:02</a>:女性在围棋职业联赛中的奋斗之路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3568">00:59:28</a>:日本将棋世界的升级打怪</span></p>]]></description>
