    <title>Vol.153聊日本｜日本也不是一开始就生吃三文鱼的；日本的副首都最终花落谁家？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af0843188191f4f6e220ffb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af0843188191f4f6e220ffb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 13:42:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这里是读报聊上周日本节目，主持人：Seki，嘉宾：嘉麟前辈</span></p><p><span>那啥，这期的音频音质有些小问题，主要是我不该相信AI剪辑……但是时间上已经不允许再手动整个重新剪辑一遍了Orz</span></p><p><span>请大家包含吧。</span></p><br><p><span>这一周我们读了10月26日到10月31号的小学生新闻。</span></p><br><p><span>1、学生提问：什么肉可以生吃？</span></p><p><span>2、日本的黑客攻击还在进行中</span></p><p><span>3、日本副首都花落谁家？</span></p><p><span>4、日本外食统计拉面第一城市：山形</span></p><p><span>5、2029年东海道新干线S0车型开始运行</span></p><p><span>6、你用过电动指甲刀吗</span></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/890a-audiofreehighqps/36/E5/GAqhbygOxjllAA2bEAT4FImS.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><span>（剩余内容在最后）</span></p><br><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">00:02:04</a>:中国古代的生鱼片文化：河鱼与海鱼的差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">00:05:34</a>:马肉和牛肉的日本生食文化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">00:11:07</a>:日本也不是一开始就生吃三文鱼的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">00:16:42</a>:日本的个人信息泄露还在进行中</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">00:22:17</a>:日本IT员工的工资待遇：从千万年薪到个人信息泄露的挑战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">00:27:54</a>:个人信息泄露：信用卡号、背面密码全部丢失，如何保护自己？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">00:33:29</a>:日本副首都：大阪和名古屋是最有竞争力的候选城市</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2341">00:39:01</a>:日本经济中心城市：大阪、东京、名古屋和福冈的比较分析</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">00:44:40</a>:拉面文化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3014">00:50:14</a>:日本都有哪些面条分类？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3349">00:55:49</a>:欢迎来名古屋尝尝跟台湾没有一毛钱关系的“台湾拉面”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3685">01:01:25</a>:你用过电动指甲刀吗</span></p><br><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/c150-audiofreehighqps/6B/46/GKwRIMAOxjoVAA0iagT4FPfk.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/a8c6-audiofreehighqps/49/23/GKwRIW4OxjqeABMSoAT4FUbB.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/9bd2-audiofreehighqps/9D/F9/GKwRIJIOxj8AADhgcAT4GHGi.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p><p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/1208-audiofreehighqps/8D/21/GKwRIMAOxj8oAAkdAgT4GIw0.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large" alt=""><br></p>]]></description>
